{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/04gfol","slideIndex":7,"text":"These are evaluation quantities used by the cited work, not measurements of this prototype. CCFR: Kikuchi & Kanai, Convex Collision-Free Regions, §4.3 Table1, Figs10–11, https://arxiv.org/html/2607.26901v1 . OGC: Chen et al., Offset Geometric Contact, Table1, §5, §5.3 Fig17, §5.4 Fig18, https://graphics.cs.utah.edu/research/projects/ogc/Offset_Geometric_Contact-SIGGRAPH2025.pdf . IPC: Li et al., Incremental Potential Contact, Fig23 and Table1, https://ipc-sim.github.io/file/IPC-paper-fullRes.pdf . CCFR reports aggregate broad-phase time; splitting build and traversal is a proposed instrumentation extension. OGC checks intersections after every frame. Convergence quantities are method-dependent; do not equate residuals across unlike solvers."}
